their financial statements one more time?

310
00:16:50,344 --> 00:16:53,138
I think that's for the best,
considering how much time has passed.

311
00:16:59,603 --> 00:17:00,979
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

312
00:17:01,855 --> 00:17:04,358
I'm ready to sign the papers now.

313
00:17:09,988 --> 00:17:12,658
I'll just need to conduct
one more financial due diligence review.

314
00:17:14,284 --> 00:17:16,286
A financial due diligence review?

315
00:17:17,996 --> 00:17:19,289
Again?

316
00:17:20,624 --> 00:17:25,546
Did you find anything unsatisfactory
when you did it last time?

317
00:17:25,629 --> 00:17:27,965
Some time has passed since then.

318
00:17:30,551 --> 00:17:32,261
Some startup CEOs

319
00:17:32,344 --> 00:17:35,180
tend to use the company's money
for private purposes.

320
00:17:36,223 --> 00:17:38,851
Of course, I know you're too meticulous
to do anything like that.

321
00:17:39,768 --> 00:17:40,727
Right?

322
00:17:42,729 --> 00:17:43,689
Of course not.

323
00:17:47,776 --> 00:17:48,986
I understand.

324
00:17:49,069 --> 00:17:52,698
If anything happens
to either you or Ye-ji,

325
00:17:52,781 --> 00:17:54,992
call me right away, okay?

326
00:17:55,075 --> 00:17:56,034
All right.

327
00:17:57,619 --> 00:17:59,496
Yes, anything at all.

328
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:01,123
Do you understand, Min-seo?

329
00:18:01,707 --> 00:18:02,541
Okay.

330
00:18:06,837 --> 00:18:08,547
You should've waited inside.

331
00:18:11,717 --> 00:18:13,010
Cool.

332
00:18:13,093 --> 00:18:15,304
This trash can is still here.

333
00:18:15,929 --> 00:18:19,558
It's the one that caught on fire, right?
The one you used the extinguisher on?

334
00:18:19,641 --> 00:18:21,768
That was the moment I fell for you.

335
00:18:23,687 --> 00:18:25,856
Yes, I remember that.

336
00:18:29,776 --> 00:18:33,655
You must be going through a lot
with the divorce and the custody battle.

337
00:18:34,907 --> 00:18:38,285
Is there anything I can do to help?

338
00:18:38,368 --> 00:18:41,580
I'm willing to do
anything for you, darling.

339
00:18:42,497 --> 00:18:43,624
You know that, right?

340
00:18:44,458 --> 00:18:45,542
I know.

341
00:18:45,626 --> 00:18:48,921
You know I trust
and depend on you too, right?

342
00:18:49,004 --> 00:18:49,838
Of course.

343
00:18:53,675 --> 00:18:55,427
Is that all you wanted to tell me?

344
00:19:02,851 --> 00:19:05,729
I'm not usually
this kind of person, but...

345
00:19:08,148 --> 00:19:09,316
I mean,

346
00:19:09,399 --> 00:19:12,110
I really didn't want to
bring this up with you.

347
00:19:12,736 --> 00:19:14,071
What is it?

348
00:19:14,154 --> 00:19:16,031
Is something going on with you?

349
00:19:18,408 --> 00:19:19,493
Well...

350
00:19:21,411 --> 00:19:24,206
I'm really sorry to ask you this...

351
00:19:26,208 --> 00:19:28,168
but can you lend me 99 million won?

352
00:19:34,258 --> 00:19:37,344
I know that was out of the blue.

353
00:19:38,303 --> 00:19:39,847
But still,

354
00:19:40,973 --> 00:19:44,351
