to bring it up with you.

355
00:19:45,394 --> 00:19:46,311
No, wait.

356
00:19:47,104 --> 00:19:47,980
Darling,

357
00:19:49,231 --> 00:19:52,317
I'm only asking you this favor
because I trust you completely.

358
00:19:55,070 --> 00:19:57,239
I'm really desperate, you know?

359
00:19:58,407 --> 00:20:01,159
I have no other way of getting money.

360
00:20:01,243 --> 00:20:03,912
How am I supposed to come up
with 500 million won in a day?

361
00:20:04,705 --> 00:20:05,581
In a day?

362
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:09,334
Did something happen yesterday?

363
00:20:10,335 --> 00:20:11,879
Is there a problem?

364
00:20:13,088 --> 00:20:14,882
It's the vacation home.

365
00:20:14,965 --> 00:20:17,885
They're saying we need to
pay the remaining balance by today.

366
00:20:17,968 --> 00:20:20,220
If we don't, we're going to be in trouble.

367
00:20:21,221 --> 00:20:22,514
But anyway,

368
00:20:24,016 --> 00:20:24,850
this is

369
00:20:26,185 --> 00:20:28,312
too much to ask, right?

370
00:20:29,938 --> 00:20:30,772
I get it.

371
00:20:30,856 --> 00:20:33,108
No matter how much we love each other,

372
00:20:33,567 --> 00:20:34,651
