373
00:20:35,694 --> 00:20:36,987
I mean, it's 99 million won.

374
00:20:37,946 --> 00:20:40,908
That's a little too much, right?

375
00:20:43,952 --> 00:20:46,747
But I'm going to play the lead
of a TV series soon.

376
00:20:47,497 --> 00:20:51,043
In a few months,
I'll certainly be able to pay you back.

377
00:20:52,878 --> 00:20:53,837
Soo-jung.

378
00:20:54,922 --> 00:20:56,298
Do you trust me, Soo-jung?

379
00:20:57,341 --> 00:20:58,467
Tell me.

380
00:20:59,259 --> 00:21:03,180
Will getting that money
solve all your problems?

381
00:21:03,263 --> 00:21:05,891
There will be no more trouble, right?

382
00:21:05,974 --> 00:21:07,684
Yes, of course.

383
00:21:10,687 --> 00:21:12,523
Then fine. I'll lend it to you.

384
00:21:13,273 --> 00:21:17,319
I can't just sit by
and watch you struggle, Jae-hong.

385
00:21:18,320 --> 00:21:19,446
Really?

386
00:21:20,864 --> 00:21:21,865
Thank you.

387
00:21:22,574 --> 00:21:24,159
Oh my goodness.

388
00:21:24,243 --> 00:21:25,494
I'm so...

389
00:21:26,203 --> 00:21:28,205
You're the best, Soo-jung.

390
00:21:35,170 --> 00:21:36,255
I love you.

391
00:21:36,630 --> 00:21:38,006
I love you so much.

392
00:21:39,091 --> 00:21:40,175
Thanks a lot.

393
00:21:41,218 --> 00:21:44,930
I don't know how I'm ever going to
make it up to you.

394
00:21:46,265 --> 00:21:48,642
I'll text you my account details now.

395
00:21:49,434 --> 00:21:50,561
So, you know.

396
00:21:53,146 --> 00:21:54,940
It's kind of urgent.

397
00:21:55,691 --> 00:21:56,942
Okay.

398
00:21:57,025 --> 00:21:58,652
- I'll send it immediately.
- Thanks.

399
00:22:00,195 --> 00:22:02,030
You still can't reach Boo-jin?

400
00:22:02,114 --> 00:22:04,241
No. She's not checking her texts either.

401
00:22:04,324 --> 00:22:05,909
We're so busy, though.

402
00:22:05,993 --> 00:22:07,286
Did something happen to her?

403
00:22:20,716 --> 00:22:21,967
<i>Yes, honey?</i>

404
00:22:23,260 --> 00:22:26,388
Guess who managed to borrow
100 million won in 30 minutes?

405
00:22:26,471 --> 00:22:27,723
<i>I wonder who it could be.</i>

406
00:22:27,806 --> 00:22:30,559
It's your husband, Lim Jae-hong.

407
00:22:30,642 --> 00:22:34,062
<i>That's amazing. You did great, honey.</i>

408
00:22:34,146 --> 00:22:35,397
I know, right?

409
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:37,733
<i>Who lent you that much money, by the way?</i>

410
00:22:38,775 --> 00:22:40,319
The CEO of my agency.

411
00:22:41,153 --> 00:22:43,906
- I finally got a starring role, right?
- <i>That's right.</i>

412
00:22:44,448 --> 00:22:46,867
- I need to catch the elevator.
- <i>Okay.</i>

413
00:22:46,950 --> 00:22:49,453
- I'll head back to the house now.
- <i>Good.</i>

414
00:23:12,392 --> 00:23:14,603
I'm sorry, but can I get off here?

415
00:23:14,686 --> 00:23:15,938
Here?

416
00:23:16,021 --> 00:23:18,023
- All right.
- Thank you.

417
00:23:25,030 --> 00:23:26,698
I'm getting off too!

418
00:23:37,084 --> 00:23:38,210
BONGGAK-DONG SECTION 2
REDEVELOPMENT PROJECT

419
00:23:46,635 --> 00:23:50,430
<i>The person you are calling is unavailable.</i>
<i>Please leave a message.</i>

420
00:23:50,514 --> 00:23:52,766
Why isn't he answering his phone?

421
00:23:54,893 --> 00:23:55,853
What the hell?

422
00:25:04,630 --> 00:25:08,091
MOM

423
00:25:10,677 --> 00:25:12,221
<i>Are you at the academy, Min-seo?</i>

424
00:25:13,055 --> 00:25:16,642
- Yes.
- <i>I just wanted to ask, did Ye-ji</i>

425
00:25:16,725 --> 00:25:18,810
<i>- </i>What are you doing there?
- <i>talk to her dad</i>

426
00:25:18,894 --> 00:25:20,646
<i>or tell you anything else?</i>

427
00:25:23,273 --> 00:25:24,608
- So?
- <i>Min-seo?</i>

428
00:25:24,691 --> 00:25:26,944
- I'm sorry?
- What were you doing here?

429
00:25:31,240 --> 00:25:32,741
- I just...
- Min-seo!

430
00:25:35,869 --> 00:25:37,829
The cats went that way!

431
00:25:40,249 --> 00:25:41,708
The cats went that way.

432
00:25:41,792 --> 00:25:43,418
I checked, and there aren't any here.

433
00:25:43,502 --> 00:25:44,628
Let's go over there.

434
00:25:52,886 --> 00:25:53,846
Just keep running.

435
00:26:12,364 --> 00:26:13,282
About yesterday...

436
00:26:14,616 --> 00:26:15,993
I'm sorry I was too harsh--

437
00:26:16,076 --> 00:26:17,411
Did you see that guy?

438
00:26:19,204 --> 00:26:21,248
Doesn't he look like
the guy from yesterday?

439
00:26:22,207 --> 00:26:23,041
What?

440
00:26:24,835 --> 00:26:25,961
The guy from yesterday?

441
00:26:27,629 --> 00:26:28,797
Did you see his face?

442
00:26:31,091 --> 00:26:32,384
No.

443
00:26:32,467 --> 00:26:33,969
I didn't exactly see him.

444
00:26:35,179 --> 00:26:36,680
I'm sure it's not true.

445
00:26:36,763 --> 00:26:40,726
40 MINUTES BEFORE THE VIDEO LEAK

446
00:26:49,318 --> 00:26:50,944
What's with the Louis Vuitton case?

447
00:26:51,028 --> 00:26:52,779
Throwing in a freebie for that bastard?

448
00:26:53,655 --> 00:26:55,991
Oh, we're going to have to
leave the bag, right?

449
00:26:56,074 --> 00:26:59,077
Your old duffel bag
should be in the storage room.

450
00:26:59,161 --> 00:27:00,120
Okay.

451
00:28:32,337 --> 00:28:34,089
2 MINUTES BEFORE THE VIDEO LEAK

452
00:28:37,885 --> 00:28:39,386
I'll just run from here.

453
00:28:50,355 --> 00:28:52,149
THE PERFECT FAMILY'S SHOCKING SECRET

454
00:30:00,008 --> 00:30:01,677
You saw the site, right?

455
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:03,095
<i>Yes, I did.</i>

456
00:30:03,804 --> 00:30:05,430
So that's over.

457
00:30:08,433 --> 00:30:09,810
Honey.

458
00:30:09,893 --> 00:30:12,938
How about I lurk
in a nearby cosmetics store

459
00:30:13,021 --> 00:30:14,314
and wait for the bastard--

460
00:30:14,398 --> 00:30:15,899
<i>Yes, good job.</i>

461
00:30:15,983 --> 00:30:18,026
<i>- Come out the Eastern Gate.</i>
<i>- </i>What?

462
00:30:18,110 --> 00:30:19,236
This is only the beginning.

463
00:30:22,656 --> 00:30:24,366
- Just show me.
- Stop it.

464
00:30:25,450 --> 00:30:27,160
I said stop it.

465
00:30:29,580 --> 00:30:31,540
What are you planning to do?

466
00:30:35,752 --> 00:30:37,337
What is this?

467
00:30:38,255 --> 00:30:39,381
Is this a GPS tracker?

468
00:30:40,799 --> 00:30:42,676
Wow, I'm impressed.

469
00:30:43,802 --> 00:30:45,512
When did you get this ready?

470
00:30:47,681 --> 00:30:49,725
You really are the best.

471
00:30:51,977 --> 00:30:53,270
This is so cool.

472
00:30:53,353 --> 00:30:56,231
I've only seen people do this in movies.
I wouldn't have thought of it myself.

473
00:30:57,191 --> 00:30:58,233
Wait, what?

474
00:30:59,318 --> 00:31:00,444
Is he taking the subway?

475
00:31:57,668 --> 00:31:58,752
- It's him, no?
- Is that him?

476
00:32:03,966 --> 00:32:06,218
- What the hell?
- What is it?

477
00:32:06,301 --> 00:32:08,804
Oh, he's moving away. Over there.

478
00:32:08,887 --> 00:32:09,763
Yes.

479
00:32:13,600 --> 00:32:14,434
That woman.

480
00:32:15,435 --> 00:32:16,436
There.

481
00:32:40,210 --> 00:32:41,545
Let's go inside.

482
00:32:41,628 --> 00:32:42,462
Okay.

483
00:32:43,922 --> 00:32:44,756
Let's go.

484
00:32:49,469 --> 00:32:51,346
I think I should handle the negotiation.

485
00:32:52,598 --> 00:32:54,516
If I take too long to come back

486
00:32:55,267 --> 00:32:56,768
