488
00:32:59,396 --> 00:33:01,064
Okay. That's a good idea.

489
00:33:03,108 --> 00:33:04,776
Good luck, honey.

490
00:33:04,860 --> 00:33:05,944
Okay.

491
00:33:06,028 --> 00:33:07,070
I'll do my best.

492
00:33:15,871 --> 00:33:18,373
GOGO MARKET
HOW SERIOUS IS YOUR PROBLEM, JAE-HONG?

493
00:33:18,457 --> 00:33:21,126
IS EVERYTHING OKAY NOW?

494
00:33:21,210 --> 00:33:22,961
YOU KNOW YOU CAN TELL ME ANYTHING

495
00:33:40,771 --> 00:33:42,064
Min-seo.

496
00:33:42,147 --> 00:33:45,567
Why didn't you answer your phone?

497
00:33:46,527 --> 00:33:48,612
Mom.

498
00:33:48,695 --> 00:33:51,490
There were tire tracks at the scene,

499
00:33:51,573 --> 00:33:53,450
and I ran into some guy too.

500
00:33:54,117 --> 00:33:56,662
What do you mean?
Did you go back to that place?

501
00:33:56,745 --> 00:33:57,704
Min-seo!

502
00:34:00,374 --> 00:34:02,376
Tell me everything.

503
00:34:02,459 --> 00:34:04,962
What guy? What did he want?

504
00:34:05,963 --> 00:34:08,549
I don't know who he is,

505
00:34:08,632 --> 00:34:11,885
but he asked me what I was doing there,

506
00:34:11,969 --> 00:34:14,555
and he was looking at the tire tracks too.

507
00:34:14,638 --> 00:34:16,223
- I think--
- There are tire tracks?

508
00:34:16,306 --> 00:34:18,642
Hold on. Who could that guy be?

509
00:34:18,725 --> 00:34:21,228
I should've checked everything
more thoroughly yesterday.

510
00:34:21,311 --> 00:34:22,396
What a mess.

511
00:34:24,147 --> 00:34:26,942
I shouldn't have trusted those neighbors
to get everything done.

512
00:34:29,611 --> 00:34:32,698
MIN-SEO'S MOTHER

513
00:34:58,265 --> 00:34:59,391
Delivery.

514
00:35:05,147 --> 00:35:06,648
Please confirm your package!

515
00:35:33,050 --> 00:35:34,218
- Captain Park?
- From the clinic?

516
00:35:37,971 --> 00:35:39,223
- Hold on.
- No.

517
00:35:39,306 --> 00:35:41,308
- Please don't.
- No, wait.

518
00:35:41,391 --> 00:35:42,851
I didn't come here to fight.

519
00:35:42,935 --> 00:35:44,978
